WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.267
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.634
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:05.033
You're here. You made it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:08.801
Happy Friday!
Happy Friday, everybody.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:09.968
Everyone's excited about this.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.667
Today, The new movie "Creed III"
hit theaters.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.734
Yeah, it's some of
the most brutal

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.133
fighting you'll see on screen

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.901
without Andy Cohen
sitting in the middle of it.

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.400
I'm telling you that right now.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.067
Let's get to some news.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.634
I read that
in the coming weeks,

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:29.801
former President Trump plans
to "amp up the attacks

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:33.234
and name-calling" on
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:36.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.200
That's actually a nice
change of pace.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.767
Usually fights between
Florida guys

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.567
take place
in a Waffle House parking lot,

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:45.701
but Trump said he was
going to up the name-calling.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:49.133
So get ready for three straight
months of "Moron DeSantis."

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.834
It's weird when a guy
goes on a name-calling spree

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:55.133
against someone who has
almost the same name.

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:57.667
It's like, "What kind
of a crazy name is Ronald?"

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:02.033
"That's the dumbest name
I've ever heard. Ronald.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:06.467
Imagine if I called
my son Ronald Trump Jr."

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:08.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.868
Yeah, it seems like
Trump and DeSantis

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.000
are really going to attack
each other's differences,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.267
but the more you
break it down,

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:14.801
they actually have
a lot in common.

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:17.267
I'll show you what I mean.
It's time for "Similarities."

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:18.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:21.968
-♪ Similarities ♪

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:25.834
-For example, DeSantis thinks
he can beat Biden.

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:27.801
Trump still thinks
he beat Biden.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.300
You see?
They have similarities.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.634
-Very similar. Yes.
-Yeah. Next up,

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.701
DeSantis wants to distance
himself from Donald Trump.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:36.934
Trump wants to distance himself
from Donald Trump Jr.

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:40.067
He's like, "No thanks.
Oh, hi, how are you?"

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:42.100
Here's another one.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.968
Trump flew classified documents
to Mar-a-Lago.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:47.901
DeSantis flew undocumented
people to Martha's Vineyard.

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:49.200
So he has some similar.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.100
-Very similar.
-Yeah. Then there's this.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:54.167
DeSantis wants more control
over Disney World.

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:57.934
Trump wants to build
a wall around Epcot.

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:01.067
"Make fake Mexico pay for it."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:04.534
Of course, DeSantis wants
to ban "woke" books.

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.234
Trump wants to wait
for the movie to come out

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:07.334
before banning.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:10.000
"I'm not going to read that."

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.934
And finally, Trump loves
the Dallas Cowboys cheerleaders.

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:15.734
DeSantis loves dressing like
the Dallas Cowboys cheerleaders.

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.033
That's it.

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:20.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.067
Meanwhile, today, I don't know
if you saw this.

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:28.067
Trump released a campaign video
calling for a national contest

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:30.667
to create futuristic
"freedom cities."

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.367
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:33.367 --> 00:02:35.167
Somehow this is going to end
with a Statue of Liberty

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:36.734
in a bikini,
I just -- I just know it.

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:37.601
I just know.

00:02:37.601 --> 00:02:38.834
Trump has a lot of big ideas.

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:41.167
He also proposed adding
a second Saint Louis arch

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.567
and painting them gold.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.300
Interesting.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.067
Some news
from the White House today.

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:51.400
President Biden hosted
German Chancellor Olaf Scholz.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.334
Yeah, Biden met with Olaf.

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:54.934
It went better than
when Trump met with him

00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:57.100
and said, "I was
expecting a snowman."

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.267
[ Laughter ]
You don't have to build it.

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.767
In my future city,
no one has to do anything."

00:03:01.767 --> 00:03:03.234
Get this.

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.767
I heard that a scientist
found a super-rare

00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:09.200
Jurassic-era insect
at a Walmart in Arkansas.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.667
[ Light laughter ]
Yeah, I mean, it's ancient.

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:14.033
And good news -- it was
immediately hired as a greeter.

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:15.334
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.334 --> 00:03:19.667
--Hey, we have to laugh
at ourselves, you know?

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:21.400
Finally, researchers
just discovered

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.868
that winemaking began
11,000 years ago.

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:26.234
Yep. To find out more,

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:27.667
tune into the new Bravo show,

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.567
"The Real Housewives
of Mesopotamia."

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:30.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:30.901 --> 00:03:32.234
We have a great show.

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:34.334
Let's go write
some thank you notes.

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:36.100
Today's Friday.
-Really?

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.734
-Yeah, that's usually when I
catch up on some personal stuff.

00:03:38.734 --> 00:03:39.901
-Really?
-Oh, yeah, I get my --

00:03:39.901 --> 00:03:41.934
-What else do you do?
-Well, I check my inbox,

00:03:41.934 --> 00:03:44.000
return e-mails, of course
I send out thank you notes.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.667
It's Friday.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:46.901
Would you guys...?

00:03:49.467 --> 00:03:50.434
Would you guys mind
if I wrote out

00:03:50.434 --> 00:03:51.734
some thank you notes tonight?

00:03:51.734 --> 00:03:53.567
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Right now?

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:54.801
-Now.
-Now?

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.400
-Yeah, in the middle
of the show.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.834
-Wow.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:04:00.133
-James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:01.267
I would love some.
[ Piano music playing gently ]

00:04:01.267 --> 00:04:03.567
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:05.467
Why is it...?

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:07.634
-Wow. That's the
Miami Sound "Asleep" Machine.

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:09.601
-Yeah. Why is he...?
[ Laughs ]

00:04:09.601 --> 00:04:11.767
Why is he so excited?
-I don't know.

00:04:11.767 --> 00:04:12.934
He loves the conga.

00:04:12.934 --> 00:04:14.534
-Yeah. [ Chuckles ]

00:04:16.167 --> 00:04:17.934
♪♪

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:21.434
Thank you, Ron DeSantis,
for being on a mission

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:23.801
to destroy two Donalds --
Trump and Duck.

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:26.834
[ Laughter, applause ]
-[ Imitates Donald Duck ]

00:04:26.834 --> 00:04:28.200
-[ Imitates Donald Duck ]

00:04:30.501 --> 00:04:31.834
Uh...

00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:33.367
♪♪

00:04:33.367 --> 00:04:36.567
Thank you, Prince Harry
and Meghan Markle's eviction

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:38.567
from the royal residence,

00:04:38.567 --> 00:04:41.367
for leading to the most epic
U-Haul procession ever.

00:04:41.367 --> 00:04:43.133
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:44.400
Get it out of here!

00:04:46.334 --> 00:04:47.501
-[ Imitates trumpets playing ]

00:04:49.901 --> 00:04:51.300
♪♪

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.567
-Thank you,
Mandalorian helmet,

00:04:53.567 --> 00:04:57.367
for looking like Iron Man
with Ozempic face.

00:04:57.367 --> 00:05:00.133
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.501
-Ozempic face.
-Ozempic face.

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:05.033
-Vitamin O.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:05:06.634 --> 00:05:08.300
♪♪

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:12.133
Thank you, Subway building new
restaurants with playgrounds,

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:15.167
for being perfect for anyone
who's walked into a Subway

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:17.501
and thought, "If only
my kids could play here."

00:05:17.501 --> 00:05:20.000
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.601
-I guess not.
-♪ I can dream ♪

00:05:22.601 --> 00:05:24.834
♪ I can dream ♪

00:05:24.834 --> 00:05:26.567
♪ I... ♪
The National's here!

00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:28.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.834 --> 00:05:34.601
♪♪

00:05:34.601 --> 00:05:36.000
Thank you,

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.767
Japan finding 7,000 islands
it didn't know existed,

00:05:39.767 --> 00:05:43.834
for being the global version of
finding $20 in your coat pocket

00:05:43.834 --> 00:05:44.934
and you're like...

00:05:44.934 --> 00:05:46.200
-Hey!
-Awesome!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.667
[ Applause ]

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:49.467
-Nice!
-Do the conga!

00:05:49.467 --> 00:05:50.400
-Do the conga on this.

00:05:52.567 --> 00:05:53.968
