[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.167 --> 00:06:03.400
-Whoa. Whoa!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.467
Hello.

00:06:05.467 --> 00:06:07.267
-That's exactly it.
-That's it.

00:06:07.267 --> 00:06:09.300
-That's it.
-That's Cocaine Bear scat.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.734
-That's it.

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:12.501
[ Chuckles ] Scat.
-[ Indistinct ]

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.434
♪♪

00:06:15.434 --> 00:06:18.767
-Thank you, pistachios,
for being nut clams.

00:06:18.767 --> 00:06:22.234
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:06:22.234 --> 00:06:24.000
-That sounds filthy.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.534
This is a family show!

00:06:25.534 --> 00:06:27.667
-Nut clams.
-Nut clams?!

00:06:27.667 --> 00:06:30.400
-[ Laughs ]
-Wait a second.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.100
I thought you were being clean.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:34.634
-We got one more joke.
-One more? Oh, my God.

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:36.000
-You think I can't top that one?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.534
-You got to top nut clam.

00:06:37.534 --> 00:06:39.834
-Oh, no way, man.

00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:41.934
-Clam it up, G.
-Here we go.

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:43.167
Here we go, G.

00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:45.501
♪♪

00:06:45.501 --> 00:06:47.133
-Thank you, KFC,

00:06:47.133 --> 00:06:50.100
for bringing back your
Double Down sandwich...

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.267
right in time for the finale
of "The Last of Us."

00:06:52.267 --> 00:06:53.601
There you go, everybody.
Thank you!

00:06:53.601 --> 00:06:54.634
Those are our thank you notes.

